{"id":"torrey:gift-of-the-holy-spirit-the","source":"torrey","name":"Gift Of The Holy Spirit, The","slug":"gift-of-the-holy-spirit-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"By the Father — Ne 9:20; Lu 11:13.","refs":[["Neh",9,20,9,20],["Luke",11,13,11,13]]},{"text":"By the Son — Joh 20:22.","refs":[["John",20,22,20,22]]},{"text":"To Christ without measure — Joh 3:34.","refs":[["John",3,34,3,34]]},{"text":"According to promise. — Ac 2:38,39.","refs":[["Acts",2,38,2,38],["Acts",2,39,2,39]]},{"text":"Upon the exaltation. — Ps 68:18; Joh 7:39.","refs":[["Ps",68,18,68,18],["John",7,39,7,39]]},{"text":"Through the intercession of Christ. — Joh 14:16.","refs":[["John",14,16,14,16]]},{"text":"In answer to prayer. — Lu 11:13; Eph 1:16,17.","refs":[["Luke",11,13,11,13],["Eph",1,16,1,16],["Eph",1,17,1,17]]},{"text":"For instruction. — Ne 9:20.","refs":[["Neh",9,20,9,20]]},{"text":"For comfort of saints. — Joh 14:16.","refs":[["John",14,16,14,16]]},{"text":"To those who repent and believe. — Ac 2:38.","refs":[["Acts",2,38,2,38]]},{"text":"To those who obey God. — Ac 5:32.","refs":[["Acts",5,32,5,32]]},{"text":"To the Gentiles. — Ac 10:44,45; 11:17; 15:8.","refs":[["Acts",10,44,10,44],["Acts",10,45,10,45],["Acts",11,17,11,17],["Acts",15,8,15,8]]},{"text":"Is abundant — Ps 68:9; Joh 7:38,39.","refs":[["Ps",68,9,68,9],["John",7,38,7,38],["John",7,39,7,39]]},{"text":"Is permanent — Isa 59:21; Hag 2:5; 1Pe 4:14.","refs":[["Isa",59,21,59,21],["Hag",2,5,2,5],["1Pet",4,14,4,14]]},{"text":"Is fruit bearing — Isa 32:15.","refs":[["Isa",32,15,32,15]]},{"text":"Received through faith — Ga 3:14.","refs":[["Gal",3,14,3,14]]},{"text":"An evidence of union with Christ — 1Jo 3:24; 4:13.","refs":[["1John",3,24,3,24],["1John",4,13,4,13]]},{"text":"An earnest of the inheritance of the saints — 2Co 1:22; 5:5; Eph 1:14.","refs":[["2Cor",1,22,1,22],["2Cor",5,5,5,5],["Eph",1,14,1,14]]},{"text":"A pledge of the continued favour of God — Eze 39:29.","refs":[["Ezek",39,29,39,29]]}],"refCount":34}
